    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tales of Miravia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fantasy RPG where you play as a hero destined to purify corrupted statues and restore balance to the world of Miravia.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Immersive Exploration</strong><br>Dive into a richly detailed world with diverse maps and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Turn-Based Strategic Combat</strong><br>Face challenging enemies using unique tactics and abilities in thrilling battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Varied Minigames</strong><br>Enjoy side activities that enhance the overall gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Visual Effects</strong><br>Experience changing weather, realistic shadows, and immersive animations that heighten the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Engaging Storyline</strong><br>Follow a deep, captivating narrative with unforgettable characters and unexpected plot twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Tales of Miravia</i> is a game in constant development. Your support and feedback are crucial for improving and expanding the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tales of Miravia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fantasy RPG where you play as a hero destined to purify corrupted statues and restore balance to the world of Miravia.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Immersive Exploration</strong><br>Dive into a richly detailed world with diverse maps and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Turn-Based Strategic Combat</strong><br>Face challenging enemies using unique tactics and abilities in thrilling battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Varied Minigames</strong><br>Enjoy side activities that enhance the overall gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Visual Effects</strong><br>Experience changing weather, realistic shadows, and immersive animations that heighten the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Engaging Storyline</strong><br>Follow a deep, captivating narrative with unforgettable characters and unexpected plot twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Tales of Miravia</i> is a game in constant development. Your support and feedback are crucial for improving and expanding the game.</p>",
    "short_description": "Immerse yourself in the world of Tales of Miravia, an action-packed RPG where every decision shapes your journey. Explore, battle, and uncover secrets in a fantasy realm filled with danger and mystery. Join the adventure today!",
    "supported_languages": "Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cTales of Miravia combina una narrativa envolvente con mec\u00e1nicas de juego t\u00e1cticas y minijuegos \u00fanicos, ofreciendo una experiencia inolvidable en un mundo de fantas\u00eda.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Final Boss Project<br>",
